  "caption": "Dawn Mode paints the band behind the lights; the ensō is the sun.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-story--sidebar\"><div class=\"kanso-sidebar--slice kanso-sidebar__top\" style=\"padding:0 8px 4px;height:92px;position:relative;overflow:hidden\"><svg class=\"kanso-dawn kanso-dawn--rising\" id=\"dawn-big\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 56\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"dw3a\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"44\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-top)\"/><stop offset=\".45\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-mid)\"/><stop offset=\".8\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-low)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-edge)\"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id=\"dw3g\" cx=\"124\" cy=\"44\" r=\"78\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" gradientTransform=\"translate(0 15.4) scale(1.65)\"><stop offset=\"0\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-sun);stop-opacity:.85\"/><stop offset=\".35\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-edge);stop-opacity:.45\"/><stop offset=\"1\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-edge);stop-opacity:0\"/></radialGradient><linearGradient id=\"dw3b\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"56\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop offset=\"0\" style=\"stop-color:var(--dawn-edge);stop-opacity:.5\"/><stop offset=\"1\" style=\"stop-color:var(--chrome);stop-opacity:0\"/></linearGradient><clipPath id=\"dw3c\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"256\" height=\"44\"/></clipPath></defs><rect width=\"256\" height=\"44\" fill=\"url(#dw3a)\"/><rect class=\"kanso-dawn__night\" width=\"256\" height=\"44\" style=\"fill:var(--dawn-top)\"/><g clip-path=\"url(#dw3c)\"><rect class=\"kanso-dawn__glow\" width=\"256\" height=\"44\" fill=\"url(#dw3g)\"/><g class=\"kanso-dawn__stars\" style=\"fill:var(--dawn-star)\"><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"7\" r=\".7\" opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"13\" r=\".5\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"212\" cy=\"6\" r=\".6\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"15\" r=\".5\" opacity=\".45\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"5\" r=\".45\" opacity=\".5\"/></g><g class=\"kanso-dawn__clouds\" style=\"stroke:var(--dawn-sun)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M28 31h58\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" opacity=\".55\"/><path d=\"M52 36h30\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\".5\"/><path d=\"M162 28h64\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" opacity=\".5\"/><path d=\"M176 34h30\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\".45\"/><path d=\"M6 39h40\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"/><path d=\"M214 40h36\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".4\"/></g><g class=\"kanso-dawn__sun\"><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"44\" r=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--dawn-sun)\" opacity=\".5\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"44\" r=\"13\" fill=\"none\" style=\"stroke:var(--dawn-sun)\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"70 12\" transform=\"rotate(-150 124 44)\" class=\"kanso-dawn__circle\"/></g></g><rect y=\"44\" width=\"256\" height=\"12\" fill=\"url(#dw3b)\"/><path class=\"kanso-dawn__horizon\" d=\"M0 44.5H256\" style=\"stroke:var(--dawn-sun)\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\".55\"/></svg><div class=\"kanso-sidebar__title\"><span class=\"kanso-window__controls\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div></div></div></div>"
 }
